The Orb OS: lineage and attribution
===================================

This file exists because the LICENSE cannot hold it. GitHub identifies a
licence by matching the file against the exact text of a known one, and prose
inserted into the middle of MIT's wording defeats that match. The repository
then reads as "NOASSERTION" rather than "MIT", which is the single word a
developer looks for before deciding whether they are allowed to use anything
here. So the licence is now verbatim MIT, and the history it used to carry
lives here instead, still travelling with the software exactly as before.

Origin
------

The Orb OS began as a fork of Quique Tortosa's Capsule Radar, and was called
Capsule Radar itself until August 2026. The original copyright is retained in
LICENSE, as MIT requires.

What is Zion Brock's later work
-------------------------------

Substantial later work is Zion Brock's: the clock, menu, settings, news and
startup screens, the SD-card theme engine, the Orb Studio serial and WiFi
protocols, and the flash art pipeline.

On the rename
-------------

The rename does not change any of the above. MIT permits modifying and
renaming, and says nothing about what a derived work may be called; what it
requires is that the copyright notice travels with the software, which it
does. The lineage is recorded here precisely BECAUSE the name no longer
carries it.

Third-party font: Sora
----------------------

The forecast screen's typeface is Sora, Copyright 2019 The Sora Project Authors
(https://github.com/sora-xor/sora-font), licensed under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1. The source font and its licence are in assets/fonts/
(Sora-Variable.ttf, Sora-OFL.txt); the src/font_sora_*.c files are bitmaps
rendered from it by tools/gen_lv_font.py.

Third-party font: Montserrat
----------------------------

The German umlauts added to the built-in Montserrat sizes (src/font_de_*.c) are
rendered from Montserrat, Copyright 2011 The Montserrat Project Authors
(https://github.com/JulietaUla/Montserrat), licensed under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1. The source font and its licence are in assets/fonts/
(Montserrat-Variable.ttf, Montserrat-OFL.txt); the bitmaps are rendered by
tools/gen_lv_font.py.

Earth imagery
-------------

assets/earth/day.jpg and night.jpg, the Earth app's pictures, are reduced from NASA Earth
Observatory's Blue Marble Next Generation (image record 74092) and Black Marble 2016 (image
record 144898), both public domain. tools/gen_earth_textures.py makes them from the originals.
